There are a couple of very useful items often overlooked by power-hungry
hackers. Check if you have all useful intrinsics (tele control? disintegr.
resistance? searching?). Helm of telepathy is very useful. Certain
spellbooks are more than very useful. Raise all your stats to
maximum, or even beyond ;-) Finally: keep one - two wishes
for later. Dire needs come when you least expect them, and you may
find yourself wishing for something you have found when still on level 4
and thrown away with disgust at that time :-)
  I almost always ascend with wishes left in wands/lamps - the goal of the
game is, after all, to ascend, not to collect maximum amount of junk...

